  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cities and Infrastructure for Growth (CIG) Results, Management &amp; Learning verifying results and facilitating learning from DFID&apos;s delivery of improved enabling environment for cities, energy and infrastructure services.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Cities and Infrastructure for Growth (CIG) Results, Management &amp; Learning verifying results and facilitating learning from DFID&apos;s delivery of improved enabling environment for cities, energy and infrastructure services. is a component of Cities and Infrastructure for Growth (CIG) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;952,099. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Urban development and management, Transport policy and administrative management, Energy policy and administrative management, Environmental policy and administrative management.</narrative>
  </description>
